  "described": {
    "alt_text": "An extremely dense neon cartoon landscape around a turquoise lake, with red cliffs, a tiny city, a striped volcano and hundreds of creatures, signed 2021.",
    "description": "A square digital drawing with white border, hand lettered title at bottom left and signature with 2021 at bottom right. A bright blue sky with large outlined clouds and a low yellow sun sits over a turquoise lake in the middle distance. Red layered cliffs drop into the lake at left, a green plateau dotted with small huts sits at right, and a striped purple volcano with a white ball on its summit rises at upper right. Below the lake the land descends through green hills to a tiny pastel city at centre, then into a foreground crammed with creatures: horned heads, eyed blobs, a pink hovering pod with eyes, a red long necked animal at lower centre, striped stalks and antennae, a blue vehicle at far left. Smoke plumes and small clouds drift at every level. Colours are intensely saturated lime, magenta, cyan and orange with heavy black outlines and a visible pencil scribble underlayer.",
    "impression": "The most packed picture in the collection, where every square inch is a resident. The lake is the only place the eye can rest, and it sits exactly in the middle like a held breath. The volcano with its ball on top is a landmark that the later works keep returning to, so this feels like the founding map of the Colorlands world.",
